WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.730
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:05.000 --> 00:12.000
"Echo Of A Letter" (Episode 14)

3
00:25.399 --> 00:27.040
Wait here for me.

4
00:27.120 --> 00:28.120
I'll go in alone.

5
00:29.199 --> 00:30.360
Okay.

6
00:30.440 --> 00:31.560
Call me if anything happens.

7
01:39.000 --> 01:40.280
Let go!

8
01:43.439 --> 01:44.320
The master said

9
01:44.400 --> 01:45.400
this would be mine.

10
01:45.480 --> 01:47.480
How come I didn't hear him say that?

11
01:47.560 --> 01:49.279
Now we listen to the First Madam.

12
01:49.359 --> 01:49.879
It's mine.

13
01:49.959 --> 01:51.000
It's mine!

14
02:01.719 --> 02:02.600
Who's there?

15
02:02.680 --> 02:03.320
Mom.

16
02:03.400 --> 02:04.239
It's me.

17
02:04.319 --> 02:05.319
Sweetheart.

18
02:29.879 --> 02:31.240
What are your plans now?

19
02:32.439 --> 02:34.039
I'll move to Hong Kong first.

20
02:34.960 --> 02:36.000
After a while,

21
02:36.080 --> 02:37.919
I'm traveling with friends for a bit.

22
02:38.520 --> 02:39.200
Okay.

23
02:39.280 --> 02:40.400
Stay safe, then.

24
02:40.960 --> 02:42.480
If you run short on money,

25
02:42.560 --> 02:43.560
just tell me.

26
02:45.759 --> 02:47.439
Didn't you hire someone to watch over me?

27
02:49.400 --> 02:50.400
Do you blame me?

28
02:51.439 --> 02:52.680
How dare I blame you?

29
02:53.599 --> 02:54.639
You're all grown up.

30
02:54.719 --> 02:55.895
You're standing on your own two feet.

31
02:55.919 --> 02:57.280
I can't control you anymore.

32
02:59.639 --> 03:00.800
Then don't worry about me.

33
03:01.639 --> 03:02.959
Right now,

34
03:03.039 --> 03:04.039
you're free.

35
03:05.080 --> 03:06.400
Go live a good life for yourself.

36
03:08.800 --> 03:09.800
I know.

37
03:17.120 --> 03:18.120
I'll get going, then.

38
03:19.879 --> 03:20.879
Sweetheart.

39
03:50.439 --> 03:51.560
Didn't you say

40
03:52.080 --> 03:53.719
you wouldn't repeat my mistakes?

41
03:56.159 --> 03:57.439
They're all the same.

42
03:58.120 --> 03:59.600
Not a single one of them is reliable.

43
03:59.800 --> 04:00.800
No.

44
04:01.840 --> 04:02.840
He's different.

45
04:04.039 --> 04:05.039
Besides,

46
04:06.520 --> 04:08.319
I can take responsibility for my own life.

47
04:09.560 --> 04:10.560
I hope you can too.

48
04:33.360 --> 04:34.480
All right.

49
04:34.560 --> 04:35.600
All right, sweetheart.

50
04:35.680 --> 04:36.879
Don't worry about me.

51
04:36.959 --> 04:39.000
Your mom knows how to move on.

52
04:55.360 --> 04:56.360
Okay.

53
04:59.279 --> 05:00.279
Okay, okay, go on.

54
05:02.399 --> 05:03.399
Okay.

55
05:04.439 --> 05:05.439
Goodbye.

56
05:29.199 --> 05:30.480
This ring

57
05:31.600 --> 05:33.079
was a gift from my sweetheart.

58
05:52.600 --> 05:53.600
Zhao Shengge.

59
05:53.680 --> 05:55.080
Let's go.

60
05:55.160 --> 05:56.160
Let's go.

61
06:20.000 --> 06:21.359
Put together a report

62
06:21.439 --> 06:22.720
on what we covered today.

63
06:22.800 --> 06:23.976
We'll discuss it at a later meeting.

64
06:24.000 --> 06:27.600
Let's aim to move the project forward at the next meeting.

65
06:27.680 --> 06:30.319
Hopefully things go smoother for us this time.

66
06:31.439 --> 06:32.439
Okay.

67
06:58.879 --> 06:59.879
Bye.

68
07:11.600 --> 07:12.960
How long have you been waiting?

69
07:13.040 --> 07:14.040
Not long.

70
07:14.720 --> 07:15.720
Let's go.

71
07:21.399 --> 07:22.559
No one has ever

72
07:22.639 --> 07:23.879
waited to take me home before.

73
07:27.319 --> 07:28.319
Zhao Shengge.

74
07:35.680 --> 07:36.759
Have a bite first.

75
07:37.319 --> 07:38.319
Here.

76
07:40.680 --> 07:42.680
A buttered pineapple bun from Firecracker Factory.

77
07:42.759 --> 07:44.439
How did you know I love this place?

78
07:44.519 --> 07:45.519
I haven't had it in ages.

79
07:46.079 --> 07:47.600
I know just as much about you

80
07:47.680 --> 07:49.280
as you know about me.

81
07:49.360 --> 07:50.399
Though someday,

82
07:51.120 --> 07:52.920
I'll know even more than you do.

83
07:55.639 --> 07:56.800
What's the plan for tonight?

84
07:57.560 --> 07:58.920
Let's eat first.

85
07:59.000 --> 08:00.680
After we finish, I'll take you somewhere.

86
08:16.066 --> 08:17.973
[Xiaolanshan]

87
08:23.040 --> 08:24.319
If you mind,

88
08:25.399 --> 08:26.759
I can turn around right away.

89
08:30.000 --> 08:31.000
I don't mind.

90
08:33.080 --> 08:34.080
Okay.

91
08:50.159 --> 08:51.159
Boss.

92
08:55.480 --> 08:56.480
Let's head inside.

93
09:13.759 --> 09:15.600
Xiaolanshan doesn't seem much different

94
09:16.159 --> 09:17.480
from sixteen years ago.

95
09:18.840 --> 09:20.240
It was converted into a sanatorium.

96
09:27.759 --> 09:28.919
I arranged things in advance.

97
09:29.480 --> 09:30.640
No one else will come around.

98
09:31.159 --> 09:32.159
I'm fine.

99
09:32.799 --> 09:33.960
Besides, you're here with me.

100
10:04.399 --> 10:06.279
I think this was my old ward.

101
10:12.679 --> 10:13.920
Room 407.

102
10:14.000 --> 10:14.839
Chen Wan,

103
10:14.919 --> 10:16.079
take your medicine.

104
10:16.159 --> 10:17.439
Up his dose of mood stabilizers.

105
10:17.519 --> 10:18.799
Don't let him cause any trouble.

106
10:20.840 --> 10:21.840
Zhao Shengge.

107
10:24.039 --> 10:25.439
For everything you went through,

108
10:25.519 --> 10:26.960
there needs to be closure.

109
10:37.360 --> 10:38.360
Zhao Shengge!

110
10:38.399 --> 10:39.880
What right do you have to lock me up?

111
10:39.960 --> 10:40.976
Taking the law into your own hands?

112
10:41.000 --> 10:42.279
This is illegal!

113
11:00.799 --> 11:01.679
Zhao Shengge,

114
11:01.759 --> 11:04.599
I never pegged you for a hopeless romantic.

115
11:04.679 --> 11:07.240
Going through all this trouble to drag me here,

116
11:07.320 --> 11:08.399
all just for him?

117
11:13.279 --> 11:14.479
Don't let him fool you.

118
11:14.559 --> 11:15.839
He's using you!

119
11:15.919 --> 11:17.079
He's just like his mother,

120
11:17.159 --> 11:18.559
selling himself

121
11:18.639 --> 11:20.439
just to toy with your feelings.

122
11:20.519 --> 11:23.480
I can't believe you'd fall for someone so tainted.

123
11:24.960 --> 11:26.360
Did you know

124
11:26.440 --> 11:28.280
that back when he was a kid, he was already...

125
11:39.480 --> 11:40.480
I know.

126
11:41.720 --> 11:44.159
That's the exact reason you're here today.

127
11:46.240 --> 11:47.519
Also, you've got it wrong.

128
11:48.600 --> 11:50.039
I pursued him.

129
11:50.759 --> 11:52.720
I was the one begging him to be with me.

130
11:59.679 --> 12:01.080
Which hand did he touch you with?

131
12:02.720 --> 12:03.720
His right hand.

132
12:04.720 --> 12:06.080
Though sixteen years ago,

133
12:06.919 --> 12:08.679
I already ruined that hand.

134
12:11.059 --> 12:12.699
Then leave the rest to someone else.

135
12:13.159 --> 12:14.200
Don't dirty your hands.

136
12:19.559 --> 12:21.080
His tongue and right hand...

137
12:21.720 --> 12:23.200
I'll have them mailed to his sister.

138
12:34.000 --> 12:35.280
Chen Bingxin is right next door.

139
12:36.000 --> 12:37.000
Want to see him?

140
12:38.919 --> 12:39.919
No need.

141
12:41.279 --> 12:43.520
I heard Chen Bingxin had a sudden brain hemorrhage

142
12:43.600 --> 12:44.879
and was sent to a sanatorium.

143
12:46.240 --> 12:47.759
Isn't this a sanatorium?

144
13:07.519 --> 13:08.799
Sixteen years ago,

145
13:08.879 --> 13:10.399
this is where we met.

146
13:11.679 --> 13:14.080
Tonight's moon is the same as sixteen years ago.

147
13:15.200 --> 13:16.360
Yet a little different, too.

148
13:17.759 --> 13:18.759
Yes.

149
13:21.399 --> 13:22.399
Zhao Shengge.

150
13:28.080 --> 13:29.639
None of what Liao Quan said is true.

151
13:31.759 --> 13:32.840
What I said is true.

152
13:34.120 --> 13:35.120
Every single word.

153
13:37.360 --> 13:39.680
Though I think there's one thing he didn't lie to me about.

154
13:41.320 --> 13:42.360
You played me.

155
13:45.519 --> 13:46.879
You said you liked me,

156
13:48.039 --> 13:49.559
yet had no intention of pursuing me.

157
13:50.399 --> 13:51.479
While pursuing me,

158
13:51.559 --> 13:53.120
you were already planning your way out.

159
13:54.759 --> 13:55.999
You said we should be together,

160
13:57.360 --> 13:59.440
yet never planned on staying together for long.

161
14:01.799 --> 14:03.639
I don't think he was slandering you at all.

162
14:08.279 --> 14:09.279
I wasn't.

163
14:10.919 --> 14:11.919
You better not be.

164
14:58.559 --> 14:59.600
Did I wake you?

165
15:00.879 --> 15:01.879
Where are you going?

166
15:03.120 --> 15:04.479
To take some medicine.

167
15:04.559 --> 15:05.559
I can't sleep.

168
15:06.279 --> 15:07.400
Monica prescribed me

169
15:07.480 --> 15:09.360
a low-dose sleep aid.

170
15:09.440 --> 15:11.120
Taking it might help me fall asleep.

171
15:13.240 --> 15:14.559
Then don't try to sleep.

172
15:19.559 --> 15:20.559
Where are we going?

173
15:21.679 --> 15:23.199
Let's sit in the living room together.

174
15:39.919 --> 15:40.959
Thank you.

175
15:41.039 --> 15:43.320
Let's pay Monica another visit tomorrow.

176
15:45.759 --> 15:46.759
Okay.

177
15:47.960 --> 15:49.919
Is it because we went to Xiaolanshan tonight?

178
15:51.159 --> 15:52.559
No.

179
15:52.639 --> 15:54.600
It's because I started thinking about my mom.

180
15:55.559 --> 15:57.320
It must have been many years ago.

181
15:57.879 --> 15:59.959
Back when I was still living in the tenement.

182
16:00.039 --> 16:01.240
One time,

183
16:01.320 --> 16:03.199
a bunch of kids beat me up.

184
16:03.279 --> 16:04.360
I was badly hurt

185
16:05.000 --> 16:07.120
and came down with a high fever when I got back.

186
16:08.399 --> 16:09.399
Back then, she

187
16:10.000 --> 16:11.800
stole a piece of jewelry from the Chen family

188
16:12.519 --> 16:14.679
and pawned it to pay for my treatment.

189
16:14.759 --> 16:16.200
She even bought me a bag of candy.

190
16:23.799 --> 16:25.320
I only found out later

191
16:25.840 --> 16:27.679
that she was beaten after she went back.

192
16:28.919 --> 16:30.600
Chen Bingxin beat her,

193
16:31.480 --> 16:33.760
and the First Madam, who ran the finances, beat her again.

194
16:34.919 --> 16:36.280
When I found out,

195
16:36.360 --> 16:37.919
I was heartbroken and furious.

196
16:38.440 --> 16:39.599
I hated

197
16:39.679 --> 16:41.080
how useless I was.

198
16:42.399 --> 16:44.279
Yet I didn't dare let her know.

199
16:46.039 --> 16:47.080
You were just a child.

200
16:48.240 --> 16:49.840
You might not believe me,

201
16:51.360 --> 16:52.679
but before I met you,

202
16:53.679 --> 16:56.360
I wanted to kill Chen Bingxin several times.

203
16:58.519 --> 17:01.399
I never even told Zhuo Zhixuan about this.

204
17:02.039 --> 17:04.079
Though he eventually picked up on it,

205
17:04.880 --> 17:07.440
so he took me to see Monica.

206
17:08.759 --> 17:10.680
He's gotten what he deserved now.

207
17:13.920 --> 17:14.920
What else?

208
17:16.119 --> 17:18.640
Also, around the time I got into your school,

209
17:18.720 --> 17:19.720
she went to a casino.

210
17:20.640 --> 17:22.160
After Chen Bingxin found out,

211
17:22.240 --> 17:24.240
he locked both of us in the basement.

212
17:31.880 --> 17:33.000
I didn't know

213
17:34.200 --> 17:35.559
she went to the casino

214
17:36.519 --> 17:39.000
so I could afford to study abroad.

215
17:39.839 --> 17:40.839
I didn't dare ask.

216
17:42.079 --> 17:43.519
I was afraid she'd say yes,

217
17:44.519 --> 17:46.160
and just as afraid she'd say no.

218
17:48.839 --> 17:51.279
After she bought my way out of Xiaolanshan,

219
17:52.319 --> 17:54.599
she didn't have a penny left to her name.

220
17:55.599 --> 17:57.599
For someone who cared so much about her looks,

221
17:59.559 --> 18:02.079
during my first year out of Xiaolanshan,

222
18:02.880 --> 18:05.079
she didn't wear a single piece of jewelry.

223
18:06.440 --> 18:07.599
Maybe that's why.

224
18:08.880 --> 18:12.080
I later developed a habit of collecting gemstones.

225
18:12.160 --> 18:14.519
She wanted me to fight for shares in Rongxin.

226
18:14.599 --> 18:16.880
Thinking back on it, she wasn't wrong.

227
18:18.440 --> 18:21.720
All of her shares went toward getting me out.

228
18:22.759 --> 18:24.559
I owed her that to begin with.

229
18:25.759 --> 18:27.160
So that's why.

230
18:28.240 --> 18:31.279
She used to be a wonderful mom.

231
18:33.240 --> 18:34.799
I really loved her.

232
18:37.359 --> 18:38.359
It's just...

233
18:40.319 --> 18:42.119
reality was too cruel.

234
18:43.400 --> 18:44.400
It's okay.

235
18:45.400 --> 18:47.040
I'm having people watch over her for you.

236
18:48.799 --> 18:50.079
She'll be fine.

237
18:51.000 --> 18:52.600
If you ever want to,

238
18:52.680 --> 18:54.079
you can see her anytime.

239
18:55.640 --> 18:56.640
No need.

240
18:58.240 --> 18:59.519
Let nature take its course.

241
19:00.200 --> 19:02.079
Things like this can't be forced.

242
19:03.400 --> 19:04.480
It's for the best this way.

243
19:06.440 --> 19:07.840
Monica said

244
19:07.920 --> 19:10.720
the biggest issue is wanting to control everything.

245
19:11.599 --> 19:12.599
Letting go

246
19:14.039 --> 19:15.039
will be better.

247
19:18.359 --> 19:19.359
Chen Wan.

248
19:20.359 --> 19:22.160
You can lean on me a little more.

249
19:28.599 --> 19:29.599
Zhao Shengge,

250
19:30.920 --> 19:34.319
you don't actually hate dogs, right?

251
19:36.799 --> 19:39.079
I saw it last time I went to the Chen house.

252
19:40.880 --> 19:42.079
I don't hate dogs.

253
19:43.200 --> 19:46.400
When I was young, I raised one just like it,

254
19:46.480 --> 19:48.400
until someone got rid of it.

255
19:50.720 --> 19:52.759
Should we get another one?

256
19:54.440 --> 19:56.160
Just like the one we saw

257
19:56.240 --> 19:58.039
by the roadside last time.

258
19:58.119 --> 19:59.439
Tiny,

259
19:59.519 --> 20:00.920
with a little round head.

260
20:01.440 --> 20:02.560
I'm not scared of that kind.

261
20:03.119 --> 20:05.759
We could take it swimming with us,

262
20:05.839 --> 20:07.999
go see the view at Victoria Harbour,

263
20:08.079 --> 20:09.440
and visit Victoria Peak.

264
20:10.680 --> 20:12.039
While you swim,

265
20:12.720 --> 20:16.000
the two of us can time you together.

266
20:18.720 --> 20:19.880
No need to get one.

267
20:21.400 --> 20:23.079
I already have one.

268
20:26.880 --> 20:27.959
Okay.

269
20:28.039 --> 20:29.039
Zhao Shengge.

270
20:29.759 --> 20:30.759
I'd love to.

271
20:42.519 --> 20:43.519
Chen Wan.

272
20:44.839 --> 20:45.880
Thank you for everything.

273
20:59.680 --> 21:02.160
I already told him not to buy such expensive clothes.

274
21:02.240 --> 21:05.199
Money should be spent on research.

275
21:05.279 --> 21:07.199
Zhao Shengge never listens no matter what I say.

276
21:07.720 --> 21:08.959
All right, Dr. Fang.

277
21:09.039 --> 21:10.959
You're getting your research funding too.

278
21:11.039 --> 21:12.335
I told you to keep the price a secret,

279
21:12.359 --> 21:13.519
and you didn't listen either.

280
21:14.359 --> 21:15.960
Xu Zhiying let it slip.

281
21:16.680 --> 21:18.015
She recently fought her two brothers

282
21:18.039 --> 21:19.519
for power in the family

283
21:19.599 --> 21:20.679
and won.

284
21:20.759 --> 21:21.839
She was in too good a mood.

285
21:23.319 --> 21:24.319
Chen Wan.

286
21:25.880 --> 21:27.136
How did you know that when I returned home,

287
21:27.160 --> 21:28.160
I'd be at Exit B3?

288
21:30.079 --> 21:32.999
Just how thoroughly did Zhuo Zhixuan sell me out?

289
21:33.079 --> 21:34.839
I didn't even have to bribe or threaten him.

290
21:35.799 --> 21:38.200
Guess your rock-solid friendship isn't all that strong.

291
21:39.480 --> 21:41.039
Actually, it's pretty simple.

292
21:41.839 --> 21:43.920
I have a friend over there I worked with before.

293
21:44.000 --> 21:46.120
Even without exact details,

294
21:46.200 --> 21:48.000
I could make a rough guess.

295
21:48.720 --> 21:49.720
That smart, huh?

296
21:50.400 --> 21:51.199
Yeah.

297
21:51.279 --> 21:52.479
And that wasn't the only time.

298
21:52.559 --> 21:53.719
There was another time.

299
21:53.799 --> 21:55.720
Remember when you were attacked in Italy?

300
21:56.440 --> 21:57.440
You have no idea

301
21:57.480 --> 21:59.959
how unreliable Haishi's paparazzi are.

302
22:00.039 --> 22:03.759
Sensationalized headlines, twisted facts, and blurred truths.

303
22:03.839 --> 22:06.880
One minute they said you were in critical condition,

304
22:06.960 --> 22:09.920
the next they said you were shot in the chest and needed an amputation.

305
22:10.000 --> 22:11.656
You have no idea how worried I was about you.

306
22:11.680 --> 22:13.319
I only hurt my hand.

307
22:13.839 --> 22:14.360
Though Minglong

308
22:14.440 --> 22:16.519
squashed the story pretty quickly,

309
22:16.599 --> 22:18.360
and the paparazzi never brought it up again.

310
22:18.440 --> 22:19.999
If I hadn't been applying for a visa

311
22:20.079 --> 22:22.640
when Zhuo Zhixuan told me you were safe,

312
22:22.720 --> 22:24.600
I really would've flown right over.

313
22:24.680 --> 22:26.319
Those tabloids really are unreliable.

314
22:27.200 --> 22:28.760
Whether Haishi's paparazzi are reliable

315
22:28.839 --> 22:30.160
on other stories, I don't know.

316
22:31.000 --> 22:32.999
When it comes to reporting on you two, though,

317
22:33.079 --> 22:34.599
they actually got some of it right.

318
22:35.400 --> 22:37.320
Like, "Young Heir Falls in Love at Repulse Bay,".

319
22:37.400 --> 22:39.479
"Secret Three-Day Tryst with Close Friend,"

320
22:39.559 --> 22:41.600
and "Zhao Heir Turns Charitable,

321
22:41.680 --> 22:43.839
Handing Out Water to Paparazzi."

322
22:44.720 --> 22:46.080
Even my mom asked me

323
22:46.160 --> 22:47.559
if you two are actually an item.

324
22:48.559 --> 22:50.479
Her mahjong buddies know we work together,

325
22:50.559 --> 22:51.856
and they're all dying of curiosity.

326
22:51.880 --> 22:53.600
Mrs. Xu reads that stuff too?

327
22:53.680 --> 22:54.719
All right, all right.

328
22:54.799 --> 22:56.679
Stop chatting about nonsense.

329
22:56.759 --> 22:59.239
Now, about controlling these metrics,

330
22:59.319 --> 23:01.160
I need to go over it clearly with you again.

331
23:01.240 --> 23:03.800
Those eco-warriors will definitely latch onto this.

332
23:03.880 --> 23:06.279
Your flight is about to depart.

333
23:06.359 --> 23:07.840
We wish you a pleasant journey.

334
23:07.920 --> 23:08.679
Look at this...

335
23:08.759 --> 23:09.479
All right, Dr. Fang.

336
23:09.559 --> 23:10.400
Let's talk once we're on the plane.

337
23:10.480 --> 23:11.120
Okay.

338
23:11.200 --> 23:12.400
We'll talk on the plane, then.

339
23:12.440 --> 23:13.920
This is very important.

340
23:17.680 --> 23:18.680
By the way,

341
23:20.759 --> 23:21.759
back when I graduated,

342
23:22.839 --> 23:24.599
I boarded from that gate right up ahead.

343
23:25.559 --> 23:26.880
I knew Zhuo Zhixuan sold me out,

344
23:26.960 --> 23:28.880
just didn't expect him to do it this thoroughly.

345
23:30.839 --> 23:32.239
Then from now on, I'll see you off.

346
23:33.720 --> 23:34.720
Okay.

347
23:43.240 --> 23:44.600
Are you sure you won't go onstage?

348
23:45.240 --> 23:47.400
Make sure you remember

349
23:48.000 --> 23:49.440
the points on environmental metrics.

350
23:49.480 --> 23:51.999
Who knows what they'll ask later.

351
23:52.079 --> 23:53.560
Don't worry, Dr. Fang.

352
23:53.640 --> 23:55.039
I'm unstoppable right now.

353
23:55.119 --> 23:57.680
Nothing's getting in my way.

354
23:59.400 --> 24:00.400
All right.

355
24:03.720 --> 24:04.600
Nervous?

356
24:04.680 --> 24:06.279
I'd be lying if I said I wasn't.

357
24:06.359 --> 24:08.320
It's my first roadshow with you.

358
24:08.400 --> 24:09.400
Still,

359
24:09.960 --> 24:10.960
we've got this.

360
24:15.039 --> 24:16.039
You got this.

361
24:18.000 --> 24:20.199
Welcome, investors and guests.

362
24:20.278 --> 24:22.919
Please, welcome our presenter today,

363
24:23.000 --> 24:24.880
Ms. Xu Zhiying,

364
24:24.960 --> 24:26.960
Mr. Fang Jian, and Mr. Chen Wan.

365
24:28.799 --> 24:30.535
Led by renowned Haishi enterprise Minglong Group,

366
24:30.559 --> 24:33.239
the Lai Chi Wun Project investment roadshow

367
24:33.319 --> 24:34.519
has officially kicked off.

368
24:34.599 --> 24:36.833
Spanning 23 cities worldwide, this roadshow event

369
24:36.893 --> 24:38.079
[Exclusive News Report: Project Reactors Xu Zhiying, Fang Jian and Chen Wan appear present]

370
24:38.200 --> 24:39.439
aims to build a collaborative,

371
24:39.519 --> 24:41.640
mutually beneficial port ecosystem.

372
24:41.720 --> 24:43.080
Project leads Xu Zhiying,

373
24:43.160 --> 24:45.679
Fang Jian, and Chen Wan appeared at the roadshow.

374
24:45.738 --> 24:48.178
Among the Lai Chi Wun leadership team,

375
24:48.279 --> 24:50.080
a fresh East Asian face

376
24:50.160 --> 24:52.120
made his debut before investors.

377
24:52.200 --> 24:54.439
This young executive, Chen Wan,

378
24:54.519 --> 24:55.959
has drawn widespread attention.

379
24:56.039 --> 24:58.199
What the Lai Chi Wun Project brings us

380
24:58.279 --> 24:59.880
is more than just an equipment upgrade—

381
24:59.960 --> 25:03.320
it is a complete paradigm shift in technology.

382
25:03.400 --> 25:06.120
The Lai Chi Wun Project attracts diverse industries,

383
25:06.200 --> 25:09.759
forming a major industrial hub in the future.

384
25:09.839 --> 25:11.880
In constructing the offshore oil support tunnel,

385
25:11.960 --> 25:14.479
we adopted eight different power technologies,

386
25:14.559 --> 25:16.400
not only reducing risks,

387
25:16.480 --> 25:18.160
while also greatly improving efficiency.

388
25:20.119 --> 25:20.959
Yes, you.

389
25:21.039 --> 25:22.080
Ms. Xu,

390
25:22.160 --> 25:24.880
how do you balance your marriage life

391
25:24.979 --> 25:26.899
and your carrier in the future?

392
25:29.039 --> 25:30.920
May I ask you, sir,

393
25:31.599 --> 25:32.679
did you get press access

394
25:32.759 --> 25:34.759
to our Lai Chi Wun Project roadshow

395
25:34.839 --> 25:36.120
through your connections

396
25:36.200 --> 25:38.319
at The Wall Street Journal?

397
25:39.680 --> 25:40.880
Excuse me,

398
25:40.960 --> 25:43.120
as head of PR for the Lai Chi Wun Project,

399
25:43.213 --> 25:45.933
staying well-informed is part of my job.

400
25:46.000 --> 25:46.759
Then, Ms. Xu,

401
25:46.845 --> 25:48.886
how do you plan to balance

402
25:48.939 --> 25:52.458
your future and your career and marriage?

403
25:52.559 --> 25:53.840
Tell me please.

404
25:53.920 --> 25:54.719
I think

405
25:54.799 --> 25:56.519
asking that question at an event like this

406
25:56.599 --> 25:57.759
is completely unprofessional.

407
25:58.599 --> 25:59.719
Next question.

408
25:59.799 --> 26:01.840
Does anyone have a question?

409
26:01.920 --> 26:02.959
Yes, you.

410
26:03.039 --> 26:03.840
Mr. Chen Wan.

411
26:03.920 --> 26:04.840
As far as I know,

412
26:04.920 --> 26:07.039
deep-sea survey technology for complex environments

413
26:07.119 --> 26:09.239
has already seen breakthroughs in Country A.

414
26:09.319 --> 26:10.535
What advantages does Minglong's technology

415
26:10.559 --> 26:12.279
hold over Country A's?

416
26:12.359 --> 26:14.679
And what impact will this project have

417
26:14.759 --> 26:16.519
on marine ecology and neighboring countries?

418
26:16.559 --> 26:17.616
This question is too sensitive.

419
26:17.640 --> 26:19.559
Should we check with upper management?

420
26:20.519 --> 26:21.840
It's fine.

421
26:21.920 --> 26:23.759
Thank you for your question.

422
26:23.839 --> 26:25.360
The technology you mentioned—

423
26:25.440 --> 26:26.800
I've heard a bit about it.

424
26:26.880 --> 26:28.039
Unfortunately, though,

425
26:28.119 --> 26:29.400
at present, that technology

426
26:29.480 --> 26:31.759
remains strictly in the laboratory stage.

427
26:31.839 --> 26:33.719
Our domestic deep-sea exploration technology

428
26:33.799 --> 26:35.840
was the first to overcome challenges in high-low

429
26:35.920 --> 26:38.199
dynamic positioning float-over installations.

430
26:38.279 --> 26:39.999
Both our modular construction technology

431
26:40.079 --> 26:41.120
and subsea operations

432
26:41.200 --> 26:43.199
have fully entered the ultra-deepwater era.

433
26:43.279 --> 26:45.880
Our all-weather, all-sea float-over capability,

434
26:45.960 --> 26:48.080
operational difficulty, and technical complexity

435
26:48.160 --> 26:49.416
have topped international rankings

436
26:49.440 --> 26:50.679
for ten consecutive years,

437
26:50.759 --> 26:52.640
and are already in active use.

438
26:52.720 --> 26:55.216
In recent years, we've partnered closely with several marine conservation member nations,

439
26:55.240 --> 26:56.759
carrying out in-depth cooperation

440
26:56.839 --> 26:58.279
with remarkable results.

441
26:58.359 --> 27:00.800
These achievements are evident to all nations,

442
27:00.880 --> 27:02.759
so please don't misattribute the credit.

443
27:02.839 --> 27:04.015
As for the Lai Chi Wun Project,

444
27:04.039 --> 27:05.039
it is not only a catalyst

445
27:05.119 --> 27:07.559
for advancing marine science and technology,

446
27:08.079 --> 27:09.479
it is also

447
27:09.559 --> 27:10.479
a driving force in protecting

448
27:10.559 --> 27:12.560
our marine ecological barrier,

449
27:12.640 --> 27:15.920
and a bridge for Asia-Pacific economic cooperation.

450
27:16.000 --> 27:17.039
This is

451
27:17.119 --> 27:18.199
the Lai Chi Wun Project's

452
27:18.279 --> 27:20.160
unwavering social responsibility,

453
27:20.240 --> 27:21.360
as well as

454
27:21.440 --> 27:22.999
our R&amp;D team's

455
27:23.079 --> 27:24.519
steadfast goal.

456
27:25.359 --> 27:26.359
Thank you.

457
27:35.880 --> 27:37.279
Today,

458
27:37.359 --> 27:38.840
we are ushering in

459
27:38.920 --> 27:40.840
a new era of smart meteorology.

460
27:40.920 --> 27:43.080
With the development of oil-monitoring robots,

461
27:43.160 --> 27:45.560
every effort is better secured,

462
27:45.640 --> 27:48.440
and every life can be better protected.

463
27:49.559 --> 27:51.999
Now I've actually made it to his side.

464
27:52.079 --> 27:54.959
The flowers and applause I never got in my youth—

465
27:55.039 --> 27:57.160
Zhao Shengge made up for all of them.

466
28:04.200 --> 28:05.200
Dr. Fang,

467
28:05.799 --> 28:07.120
regarding the upcoming project,

468
28:07.200 --> 28:08.480
I need to follow up with you.

469
28:09.640 --> 28:10.640
Congratulations.

470
28:11.799 --> 28:12.839
Thanks for your hard work.

471
28:17.640 --> 28:19.119
Did you pick these flowers?

472
28:20.200 --> 28:21.319
You copied me.

473
28:21.839 --> 28:23.120
I thought you'd like them.

474
28:23.200 --> 28:24.360
Zhao Shengge,

475
28:24.440 --> 28:25.560
let me tell you a secret

476
28:25.640 --> 28:27.160
that not even Zhuo Zhixuan knows.

477
28:27.839 --> 28:28.759
Back in junior year of high school,

478
28:28.839 --> 28:30.679
when you broke the swimming record,

479
28:30.759 --> 28:32.360
I sent you a bouquet of flowers.

480
28:32.440 --> 28:33.800
I didn't mean anything else by it.

481
28:34.680 --> 28:36.400
I simply wanted to congratulate you.

482
28:37.759 --> 28:39.479
White peonies stand for sincerity,

483
28:39.559 --> 28:41.319
and pink hydrangeas stand for fulfillment.

484
28:41.880 --> 28:44.719
I hoped that no matter what you did,

485
28:44.799 --> 28:46.519
it would be successful and fulfilling.

486
28:48.079 --> 28:48.640
Back then, though,

487
28:48.720 --> 28:50.999
you thought they were from a stranger,

488
28:51.079 --> 28:53.319
so you casually handed my flowers to someone else.

489
28:56.759 --> 28:57.759
I'm sorry.

490
28:58.880 --> 29:00.199
It's okay.

491
29:00.279 --> 29:01.720
I've already gotten my flowers.

492
29:02.680 --> 29:03.680
Let's go.

493
29:15.640 --> 29:16.640
It's snowing.

494
29:17.440 --> 29:18.600
Let's go take a look.

495
29:18.680 --> 29:19.239
Come on.

496
29:19.319 --> 29:21.199
At the Lai Chi Wun Project Roadshow,

497
29:21.279 --> 29:23.640
Project Lead Chen Wan Shines Bright.

498
29:24.200 --> 29:26.519
Lai Chi Wun Project CTO Chen Wan:

499
29:26.599 --> 29:27.896
Honed In and Deepened by Past Experience.

500
29:27.920 --> 29:29.200
The snow is coming down so hard.

501
29:30.200 --> 29:31.360
Careful not to catch a chill.

502
29:35.480 --> 29:36.480
Look.

503
29:37.319 --> 29:40.640
That's where you attended your first press conference

504
29:40.720 --> 29:42.079
for a cross-border acquisition.

505
29:44.119 --> 29:45.439
Look at that hall.

506
29:45.519 --> 29:46.519
That hall

507
29:46.599 --> 29:49.320
is where reporters secretly photographed you for the first time.

508
29:49.400 --> 29:50.279
Really?

509
29:50.359 --> 29:51.279
Yeah.

510
29:51.359 --> 29:53.320
I think it was when I attended that year's.

511
29:53.400 --> 29:55.400
Pacific Rim Economic Cooperation Forum.

512
29:56.880 --> 29:57.880
Then...

513
29:58.559 --> 30:00.319
what were you doing around that time?

514
30:01.799 --> 30:02.799
Me?

515
30:03.880 --> 30:05.295
I was subtly fishing for news about you

516
30:05.319 --> 30:07.319
from Zhuo Zhixuan,

517
30:07.880 --> 30:09.479
and constantly studying

518
30:09.559 --> 30:11.039
finance and economics,

519
30:11.119 --> 30:12.960
planning to found Kexiang.

520
30:15.193 --> 30:16.193
That time in your life—

521
30:16.839 --> 30:18.400
I've already missed out on it forever.

522
30:41.559 --> 30:43.160
I don't want to miss out anymore.

523
30:45.039 --> 30:46.039
All right.

524
30:55.799 --> 30:57.080
Chen Wan,

525
30:57.160 --> 30:58.359
I have something for you.

526
30:59.359 --> 31:00.359
What is it?

527
31:08.960 --> 31:09.960
Take a look.

528
31:11.039 --> 31:13.439
This isn't to celebrate your successful roadshow.

529
31:13.519 --> 31:15.495
Actually, I've wanted to give this to you for a long time,

530
31:15.519 --> 31:17.176
but it got delayed for quite a while recently.

531
31:17.200 --> 31:19.240
Haishi Homeless Children Foundation.

532
31:20.119 --> 31:20.999
If I remember right,

533
31:21.079 --> 31:23.079
after Haishi's new financial regulations came out,

534
31:23.119 --> 31:24.775
setting up a foundation became really difficult.

535
31:24.799 --> 31:25.160
How did you...

536
31:25.240 --> 31:26.120
That day,

537
31:26.200 --> 31:27.519
outside the shooting club,

538
31:27.599 --> 31:29.015
you helped that little boy pick up bottles.

539
31:29.039 --> 31:30.039
I saw it.

540
31:30.839 --> 31:32.095
You kept sponsoring him after that,

541
31:32.119 --> 31:33.119
didn't you?

542
31:36.519 --> 31:38.240
Why didn't I see you that day?

543
31:38.920 --> 31:39.840
Because

544
31:39.920 --> 31:42.733
you were having a great time chatting with Qin Zhaoting.

545
31:44.279 --> 31:45.120
Zhao Shengge,

546
31:45.200 --> 31:47.119
you fired a shot toward me that day.

547
31:48.359 --> 31:49.600
Come to think of it,

548
31:49.680 --> 31:51.240
why did you shoot toward me?

549
31:52.279 --> 31:53.279
Back then, you...

550
31:53.319 --> 31:55.399
You just happened to be standing next to the target.

551
31:56.799 --> 31:58.176
I wondered for a long time that day

552
31:58.200 --> 31:59.279
whether you disliked me.

553
32:01.960 --> 32:03.160
I didn't.

554
32:03.240 --> 32:05.360
Don't tell me you already liked me back then.

555
32:05.440 --> 32:06.440
That early?

556
32:08.839 --> 32:09.879
Let me show you something.

557
32:18.599 --> 32:19.599
Open it and see.

558
32:31.759 --> 32:33.199
This robot

559
32:33.279 --> 32:36.039
looks identical to the one in Shaw Building.

560
32:36.839 --> 32:37.839
Right?

561
32:38.480 --> 32:40.039
That one was made for the university.

562
32:40.680 --> 32:41.880
This one is specially for you.

563
32:43.400 --> 32:44.400
Though,

564
32:45.279 --> 32:46.840
even though I'm giving it to you,

565
32:46.920 --> 32:49.560
you can still talk to me whenever you have something on your mind.

566
32:50.720 --> 32:52.479
Everything you used to say to it,

567
32:52.559 --> 32:53.879
you can say to me all over again.

568
32:55.839 --> 32:56.839
Zhao Shengge,

569
32:57.640 --> 32:59.599
it seems like you really love me.

570
33:00.799 --> 33:02.200
You're only realizing that now?

571
33:08.799 --> 33:10.759
I was under a lot of pressure back then,

572
33:11.279 --> 33:14.120
and I wasn't really used to talking to people,

573
33:14.200 --> 33:15.920
so I'd sneak into Shaw Building

574
33:16.000 --> 33:17.559
to chat with the robot.

575
33:18.119 --> 33:18.800
Every time after talking to it,

576
33:18.880 --> 33:20.279
I'd feel so much better.

577
33:21.680 --> 33:23.039
It's been so long now,

578
33:23.720 --> 33:24.840
I don't even really remember

579
33:24.920 --> 33:26.200
what I said.

580
33:27.920 --> 33:29.519
Then there's no need to recall it.

581
33:31.559 --> 33:32.800
Every time I finished talking,

582
33:32.880 --> 33:34.359
my heart would feel much lighter.

583
33:35.240 --> 33:37.160
It was just rough on Zhuo Zhixuan.

584
33:37.240 --> 33:38.240
You have no idea.

585
33:38.279 --> 33:41.120
The first time he saw me chatting with the robot,

586
33:41.200 --> 33:43.400
you wouldn't believe how shocked he looked.

587
33:43.480 --> 33:44.560
And then he had to pretend

588
33:44.640 --> 33:46.039
like it was no big deal at all.

589
33:46.119 --> 33:48.400
You have no idea how thoughtful he was trying to be.

590
34:00.519 --> 34:01.759
Thank you.

591
34:01.839 --> 34:02.839
These gifts—.

592
34:03.480 --> 34:04.519
I love them all.

593
34:05.079 --> 34:06.079
No need to thank me.

594
34:07.079 --> 34:08.479
You'll have to pay me back.

595
34:08.559 --> 34:09.559
How?

596
34:41.960 --> 34:42.840
Sir,

597
34:42.920 --> 34:43.920
right this way.

598
34:46.320 --> 34:47.800
We have a gathering today.

599
34:47.880 --> 34:49.760
We shouldn't have stayed up so late last night.

600
34:49.880 --> 34:52.480
Maybe it would've been earlier if you'd put the robot down sooner.

601
34:53.880 --> 34:54.880
By the way, Zhao Shengge,

602
34:56.679 --> 34:58.559
I just noticed something.

603
34:58.639 --> 34:59.776
On the cufflinks you gave me,

604
34:59.800 --> 35:02.400
there's a tiny circle on the bottom.

605
35:02.480 --> 35:03.599
Could you tell me

606
35:03.679 --> 35:04.679
what it means?

607
35:06.039 --> 35:06.720
Drop it.

608
35:06.800 --> 35:08.120
It doesn't mean anything special.

609
35:08.440 --> 35:09.440
Zhao Shengge.

610
35:12.880 --> 35:13.920
It just means

611
35:14.000 --> 35:15.239
that you're really stubborn.

612
35:17.559 --> 35:18.879
Let's go, we're going to be late.

613
35:20.039 --> 35:20.479
Chen Wan.

614
35:20.559 --> 35:21.320
Shengge.

615
35:21.400 --> 35:22.599
Mr. Tan.

616
35:22.679 --> 35:23.360
Did everything go smoothly?

617
35:23.440 --> 35:24.679
When did you land?

618
35:25.320 --> 35:26.320
With yesterday's weather,

619
35:26.400 --> 35:28.639
Shen Zongnian's private jet was bumpy as hell.

620
35:28.719 --> 35:29.959
Halfway through my nap,

621
35:30.039 --> 35:32.055
I thought the plane was doing somersaults in the troposphere.

622
35:32.079 --> 35:33.319
The roadshow was a big success.

623
35:33.639 --> 35:34.079
Congratulations.

624
35:34.639 --> 35:35.639
Thank you.

625
35:35.679 --> 35:37.559
It's the result of everyone's hard work.

626
35:39.639 --> 35:41.320
In this awful Manchester weather,

627
35:42.039 --> 35:43.175
look at how little you're wearing.

628
35:43.199 --> 35:45.039
Trying to show off how cold-resistant you are?

629
35:45.480 --> 35:46.480
What do you know?

630
35:46.519 --> 35:47.599
It's called fashion.

631
35:47.679 --> 35:49.400
Look how dashing it makes me.

632
35:49.480 --> 35:50.720
You're the one freezing.

633
35:50.800 --> 35:52.079
Come on, we're late.

634
36:01.880 --> 36:03.320
This banquet hall...

635
36:04.199 --> 36:05.959
Come, let me introduce you to a few friends.

636
36:29.199 --> 36:30.199
How's it going?

637
36:31.039 --> 36:32.039
Pursuing him.

638
36:33.519 --> 36:35.720
With a personality like his,

639
36:35.800 --> 36:37.240
I thought once he was in your hands,

640
36:37.400 --> 36:39.495
you'd definitely have him wrapped around your finger.

641
36:39.519 --> 36:40.519
Is that so?

642
36:42.119 --> 36:43.896
The one nursing a crush and making the first move

643
36:43.920 --> 36:45.679
can stop their feelings anytime.

644
36:46.320 --> 36:47.520
Whereas the one who falls hard

645
36:48.519 --> 36:49.936
can only do everything in their power

646
36:49.960 --> 36:51.719
to hold on to and ask for that devotion.

647
36:53.320 --> 36:54.320
In this relationship,

648
36:54.400 --> 36:55.639
the one holding the upper hand

649
36:56.199 --> 36:57.199
has never been me.

650
36:59.519 --> 37:00.519
You're on the back foot?

651
37:01.119 --> 37:02.119
What?

652
37:03.639 --> 37:04.639
Forget it.

653
37:05.760 --> 37:07.360
There's a lid for every pot.

654
37:08.559 --> 37:09.999
Don't you think?

655
37:10.079 --> 37:10.880
Chen Wan,

656
37:10.960 --> 37:12.960
it has a great pleasure to meet you.

657
37:13.920 --> 37:14.959
Just call me Keats.

658
37:15.039 --> 37:16.360
A little jewelry for you—

659
37:16.439 --> 37:18.479
just a small token of my fppreciation.

660
37:18.559 --> 37:19.655
You've come a long way,

661
37:19.679 --> 37:21.320
these jewels are far too precious.

662
37:21.400 --> 37:22.720
But I accept your kind intent.

663
37:22.800 --> 37:24.519
I have prepared some specialty today.

664
37:24.599 --> 37:26.599
This gift is small. Just take it.

665
37:26.679 --> 37:28.760
It's been a great pleasure talking to you.

666
37:28.833 --> 37:31.152
There will be a music concert between two days.

667
37:31.239 --> 37:32.440
Will you like to join me?

668
37:33.320 --> 37:34.400
Excuse me,

669
37:34.466 --> 37:35.065
I just...

670
37:35.159 --> 37:36.159
Chen Wan.

671
37:37.880 --> 37:38.880
Just a minute.

672
37:41.320 --> 37:42.400
It's about time.

673
37:43.159 --> 37:44.159
We can head out now.

674
37:45.159 --> 37:46.439
What about Ms. Xu and Dr. Fang?

675
37:46.519 --> 37:47.519
Where did they go?

676
37:47.559 --> 37:49.279
Fang Jian made a brief appearance and left.

677
37:49.440 --> 37:51.680
Dining gets in the way of his grand scientific pursuits.

678
37:52.159 --> 37:53.240
Ms. Xu went back.

679
37:53.320 --> 37:54.360
She's not coming with us.

680
37:54.440 --> 37:55.360
She's going on vacation in Northern Europe.

681
37:55.440 --> 37:56.440
That's nice.

682
37:57.800 --> 37:58.680
Are you tired?

683
37:58.760 --> 37:59.800
I'm fine.

684
37:59.880 --> 38:00.880
Let's go.

685
38:11.800 --> 38:12.976
Is the view from the 72nd floor

686
38:13.000 --> 38:14.680
better than a concert?

687
38:14.760 --> 38:15.760
Keats.

688
38:19.559 --> 38:20.240
Zhao Shengge,

689
38:20.320 --> 38:21.639
I didn't agree to go

690
38:21.719 --> 38:22.760
to the concert with him.

691
38:26.800 --> 38:28.360
I don't know what you're talking about.

692
38:28.400 --> 38:29.679
You can do whatever you want.

693
38:30.880 --> 38:32.159
I won't interfere.

694
39:14.159 --> 39:15.159
Zhao Shengge,

695
39:16.039 --> 39:17.719
in the cabinet over there,

696
39:18.719 --> 39:20.039
on the second shelf,

697
39:20.119 --> 39:21.119
there's something inside.

698
39:21.199 --> 39:22.679
Could you go get it for me?

699
39:42.119 --> 39:43.320
This letter—

700
39:43.400 --> 39:45.400
everything I've wanted to say to you

701
39:45.480 --> 39:47.280
over the past sixteen years

702
39:47.360 --> 39:48.480
is all in here.

703
39:50.639 --> 39:51.720
From now on,

704
39:51.800 --> 39:53.639
you don't need to ask Zhuo Zhixuan anymore.

705
39:53.719 --> 39:55.320
You can just ask me.

706
39:56.440 --> 39:58.055
Even though I'd really love to see the look on your face

707
39:58.079 --> 39:59.400
when you read this letter,

708
40:00.039 --> 40:01.719
I'm going to take a shower now.

709
40:04.239 --> 40:05.239
Okay.

710
40:28.760 --> 40:29.240
Zhao.

711
40:29.320 --> 40:30.039
Sheng-

712
40:30.119 --> 40:31.400
ge.

713
40:31.480 --> 40:33.320
Just writing your name

714
40:33.400 --> 40:35.119
has already taken everything I have.

715
40:35.719 --> 40:37.880
Your name is an incantation.

716
40:38.400 --> 40:40.599
For someone brimming with secrets,

717
40:40.679 --> 40:42.280
merely writing it down by hand

718
40:42.800 --> 40:44.719
feels like breaking some taboo.

719
40:45.639 --> 40:46.920
I don't know if this letter

720
40:47.000 --> 40:48.280
will ever be sent,

721
40:49.159 --> 40:50.639
just like the countless ones

722
40:50.719 --> 40:52.000
before it.

723
41:02.239 --> 41:04.240
A secret crush requires good manners.

724
41:04.320 --> 41:06.639
Unrequited love has its fundamental rules.

725
41:07.400 --> 41:09.599
Perhaps I shouldn't even write these letters.

726
41:10.360 --> 41:11.360
These thoughts

727
41:11.440 --> 41:13.920
should circle silently within my chest.

728
41:14.440 --> 41:15.559
There is no reason,

729
41:15.639 --> 41:17.320
nor should you have to bear,

730
41:17.400 --> 41:20.119
any burden because of them.

731
41:25.239 --> 41:26.400
Mr. Zhao,

732
41:26.480 --> 41:27.679
I hope you always win.

733
41:28.199 --> 41:29.599
I wish you good fortune.

734
41:29.679 --> 41:31.559
I hope you stay healthy and never fall ill.

735
41:32.199 --> 41:34.079
I hope many people hold you dear.

736
41:34.679 --> 41:36.079
Most of all, I hope

737
41:36.159 --> 41:37.159
you are happy.

738
41:42.679 --> 41:44.119
Just thinking of those words,

739
41:44.199 --> 41:46.800
"You can take any of the fruit on the table,"

740
41:47.360 --> 41:49.000
they still echo in my ears.

741
41:49.719 --> 41:51.920
A few mere minutes in time

742
41:52.000 --> 41:54.280
can be an eternity in my memory.

743
41:55.320 --> 41:56.240
So

744
41:56.320 --> 41:58.079
I will love the world you exist in,

745
41:58.679 --> 41:59.960
take the journeys you've taken,

746
42:00.800 --> 42:02.079
see the sights you've seen,

747
42:03.280 --> 42:04.760
and write the poems you've understood

748
42:05.440 --> 42:07.400
yet left unspoken.

749
42:08.519 --> 42:09.519
Chen Wan.

750
43:25.719 --> 43:27.359
Why did you suddenly want to go by water?

751
43:28.559 --> 43:30.559
Didn't you say you wanted to go to Feiling Island?

752
43:31.119 --> 43:32.119
You still remember.

753
43:35.119 --> 43:35.959
Mr. Zhao, Mr. Chen,

754
43:36.039 --> 43:37.360
your boat is ready.

755
43:37.440 --> 43:39.240
Would you two like to board now?

756
43:39.320 --> 43:40.520
Is this a new boat you bought?

757
43:41.239 --> 43:41.719
No.

758
43:42.239 --> 43:43.280
This is our boat.

759
43:46.679 --> 43:48.199
Let's go aboard and take a look first.

760
43:49.440 --> 43:50.440
Right this way.

761
43:58.079 --> 43:58.999
It's gorgeous.

762
43:59.079 --> 44:00.079
Thank you.

763
44:07.079 --> 44:08.639
This is a model of the ship.

764
44:08.719 --> 44:10.360
I had the designer make a new one

765
44:11.559 --> 44:13.599
to keep in my office.

766
44:13.679 --> 44:15.680
You can think of a name for it.

767
44:15.760 --> 44:17.599
I'll have someone paint it on later.

768
44:18.960 --> 44:20.120
Since you're giving it to me,

769
44:21.079 --> 44:22.079
you should name it.

770
44:23.400 --> 44:24.159
Then let's call it

771
44:24.239 --> 44:24.999
the Keats.

772
44:25.079 --> 44:26.079
How does that sound?

773
44:26.599 --> 44:27.880
Sounds great.

774
44:27.960 --> 44:29.320
Later on, we'll have the Keats

775
44:29.400 --> 44:31.720
make the maiden voyage after Lai Chi Wun's transformation.

776
44:33.559 --> 44:36.000
Back when the Lai Chi Wun Pier project was first launched,

777
44:36.920 --> 44:37.840
I did daydream about

778
44:37.920 --> 44:39.239
owning a boat myself

779
44:40.159 --> 44:41.799
and claiming Lai Chi Wun's maiden voyage.

780
44:42.440 --> 44:44.280
Back then, it felt like pure wishful thinking.

781
44:44.840 --> 44:45.840
But now...

782
44:46.519 --> 44:48.360
You decide the route for the maiden voyage.

783
44:48.440 --> 44:49.680
We

784
44:49.760 --> 44:51.039
can spend our honeymoon at sea.

785
44:51.920 --> 44:52.920
What do you think,

786
44:55.960 --> 44:56.960
Chen Wan?

787
44:58.119 --> 44:59.119
Spend our what?

788
45:00.119 --> 45:01.480
You heard what I said.

789
45:03.119 --> 45:04.599
Didn't you refuse to make it official

790
45:05.920 --> 45:07.400
because you still wanted to court me?

791
45:07.519 --> 45:09.279
I can keep courting you after we're married.

792
45:15.079 --> 45:15.920
Okay.

793
45:16.000 --> 45:17.000
Sounds good.

794
45:31.840 --> 45:32.439
Chen Wan,

795
45:32.519 --> 45:33.880
take a look.

796
45:33.960 --> 45:34.760
In the blueprints,

797
45:34.840 --> 45:36.480
we can change anything you don't like.

798
45:39.159 --> 45:41.200
This is a bowling alley.

799
45:41.280 --> 45:43.119
I get the feeling you quite enjoy bowling.

800
45:44.599 --> 45:45.639
Over here

801
45:45.719 --> 45:47.200
is the observation deck for fishing.

802
45:47.280 --> 45:48.736
When the time comes, I'll put up a Christmas tree.

803
45:48.760 --> 45:49.880
When we head out to sea,

804
45:49.960 --> 45:50.960
you can fish right here.

805
45:51.960 --> 45:54.119
We can also put a lounge chair right here

806
45:54.199 --> 45:55.760
so you can nap beside me.

807
45:56.960 --> 45:57.840
Oh, right.

808
45:57.920 --> 45:59.119
This is the bar.

809
45:59.199 --> 46:00.495
Once I pick out the wine cabinets,

810
46:00.519 --> 46:01.519
you can pick the drinks.

811
46:03.400 --> 46:04.400
Okay.

812
46:05.360 --> 46:05.840
Thanks.

813
46:05.920 --> 46:08.296
I've note down the custom trips for the yacht.

814
46:08.319 --> 46:10.399
Everything will be done before we cast off.

815
46:10.480 --> 46:11.480
Perfect.

816
46:13.559 --> 46:15.999
When did you go see the designer?

817
46:16.079 --> 46:16.720
I

818
46:16.800 --> 46:18.479
went before the roadshow.

819
46:18.559 --> 46:19.599
Looks like you're

820
46:19.679 --> 46:21.439
still keeping a lot of things

821
46:21.519 --> 46:22.519
from me.

822
46:25.000 --> 46:26.000
There's nothing else.

823
46:29.800 --> 46:31.119
Sorry, let me take this call.

824
46:32.679 --> 46:33.159
Hello?

825
46:33.239 --> 46:34.239
What is it?

826
46:36.159 --> 46:37.159
Good man.

827
46:38.519 --> 46:39.599
I'm not.

828
46:39.679 --> 46:40.920
Chen Wan is.

829
46:41.000 --> 46:42.280
Everything I've done

830
46:42.880 --> 46:44.960
doesn't even come close to how good he's been to me.

831
46:54.840 --> 46:56.120
We've arrived at Feiling Island.

832
46:57.679 --> 46:59.039
We should've come a long time ago.

833
47:04.039 --> 47:05.599
Sometimes, looking at the ocean,

834
47:06.559 --> 47:08.519
makes you feel how truly tiny humans are,

835
47:09.159 --> 47:11.599
and how little is actually up to us.

836
47:11.679 --> 47:13.159
Even a massive project

837
47:13.239 --> 47:14.680
like the Full Moon Channel

838
47:14.760 --> 47:15.479
is really nothing more than

839
47:15.559 --> 47:17.800
a drop in the ocean amid the shifting stars.

840
47:21.159 --> 47:22.280
Then take hold of the things

841
47:22.360 --> 47:23.679
you can decide for yourself.

842
47:25.000 --> 47:26.159
Do your best,

843
47:26.239 --> 47:27.279
and take things in stride.

844
47:29.440 --> 47:30.440
Zhao Shengge,

845
47:31.079 --> 47:32.200
are you

846
47:32.280 --> 47:34.440
always this calm and objective?

847
47:35.960 --> 47:36.960
No.

848
47:38.639 --> 47:39.639
Though,

849
47:42.320 --> 47:43.920
you should know what the exception is.
